A||||5||DutchFiero||Poor taking off||||1||
Z||000000||DutchFiero||12-17-2001||12:39 PM||||I have a aut. GT '86 2.8 V6.<BR>When I hit the gas, the car hesitates to take off for about a split second, and then begins to move.<BR>Anybody know why, and how i can fix it, <BR>TNX,<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||camon||12-17-2001||01:14 PM||||I had the same problem when I first got mine.<P>Things that have been replaced trying to troubleshoot the problem (in order of completion):<BR>Spark plugs (rapid fires), wires, air filter, Chevron fuel injection cleaner, EGR Valve, coil (accel), Fuel filter, fuel pump.<P>Well the hesitation was still there after replacing everything but the fuel filter and fuel pump. I noticed some improvemnet when I installed the plugs and coil but there was still slight hesitation. Well the fuel pump then died and was forced to change the pump and after it was replaced there was nolonger a hestiation.<P>Now i'm not saying it's your fuel pump (cause chances are it isn't) just want you to know it was in my case. Just wanted to give you some things to try! You could also add a control module to the list of things to get checked.<P>------------------<BR>   Keith<BR>1987 Fiero GT<p>[This message has been edited by camon (edited 12-17-2001).]||||reg||12
Z||000002||loafer87gt||12-17-2001||01:28 PM||||Is there much play in your engine mounts? This could contribute to the problem as well.||||reg||1
Z||000003||DutchFiero||12-17-2001||02:48 PM||||No, their aint much play around the engine mounts.<BR>I thought that it might be something like the fuelpump of the air intake adjuster||||reg||1
Z||000004||conductor||12-17-2001||06:02 PM||||Hey Dutchfiero, welcome to the forum.<BR>I wanted to know where you come from and who you are but I couldn't, since you didn't fill in your name etc.<BR>I hope you enjoy your time here as well as your Fiero, cause a lot of great people and tons of information here.<BR>Grtx Richard.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||BC-GT||12-17-2001||09:33 PM||||Replacing the fuel pressure regulator worked for me.||||reg||1
